<%- include('../partials/header') %><section id="home" class="hero"><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center g-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="eyebrow">A happy place to begin</span><h1>Little steps today.<br><span>Bright futures tomorrow.</span></h1><p class="hero-copy">At Jeffersons Preschool, we believe every child deserves a warm welcome, room to explore, and confidence to discover what they can do.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg rounded-pill" href="/#admissions">Apply for admission</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg rounded-pill" href="/#about">Get to know us</a></div><p class="mt-4 text-secondary">♡ Caring guidance · Learning through play · A strong foundation</p></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="hero-art"><img class="playground-scene" src="/images/playground.svg" width="720" height="580" alt="Illustration of African preschool children playing ball and skipping together in a sunny school playground"><div class="floating-note">🌱 <div><strong>Every child can grow</strong><small>At their own pace, in their own way.</small></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="about" class="container section"><div class="text-center mb-4"><span class="eyebrow">Our promise</span><h2>A little school with a big heart</h2><p>We work alongside families to make each child's early learning years meaningful.</p></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature peach"><span>🧩</span><h3>Learn by exploring</h3><p>Children build understanding through play, stories, creative activities and discovery.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature mint"><span>💛</span><h3>Feel safe and valued</h3><p>A caring environment helps little learners feel comfortable, seen and ready to participate.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature lavender"><span>🌟</span><h3>Grow with confidence</h3><p>We encourage curiosity, friendships, independence and the joy of trying something new.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="visit-band"><div class="container d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3"><div><span class="eyebrow">Your next step</span><h2>Come and meet our school.</h2><p class="mb-0">Tell us about your child and we'll help you understand admissions.</p></div><a class="btn btn-dark btn-lg rounded-pill" href="/#contact">Talk to our team</a></div></section><section id="programs" class="container section"><div class="text-center mb-4"><span class="eyebrow">Learning through play</span><h2>A place for every little learner</h2><p>Care, creativity and discovery at every stage.</p></div><div class="row g-4"><% [{n:'Daycare',d:'A nurturing daily routine with care, play and rest.'},{n:'Playgroup',d:'Friendships, language, movement and creative exploration.'},{n:'PP1',d:'Early literacy, numeracy and growing confidence.'},{n:'PP2',d:'Building a strong foundation for the next learning step.'}].forEach(p=>{ %><div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-3"><article class="feature mint"><h3><%= p.n %></h3><p><%= p.d %></p><a href="#admissions">Explore admissions &darr;</a></article></div><% }) %></div></section><section id="admissions" class="container section"><span class="eyebrow">Join our school</span><h2>A happy beginning starts here</h2><p>Choose a programme, create or sign in to your parent account, and complete your child's admission form. Our team will review your details and documents.</p><%- include('../partials/programme-admissions') %></section><%- include('../partials/contact-section') %><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
